#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:6
msgid "Defining extension modules"
msgstr "定义扩展模块"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:8
msgid ""
"A C extension for CPython is a shared library (for example, a ``.so`` file "
"on Linux, ``.pyd`` DLL on Windows), which is loadable into the Python "
"process (for example, it is compiled with compatible compiler settings), and"
" which exports an :dfn:`export hook` function (or an old-style "
":ref:`initialization function <extension-pyinit>`)."
msgstr ""
"针对 CPython 的 C 扩展就是一个共享库（例如，Linux 上的 ``.so`` 文件，Windows 上的 ``.pyd`` "
"DLL），它可被加载到 Python 进程中（例如，它可以用兼容的编译器设置进行编译），而这会导出一个 :dfn:`导出钩子` 函数 (或旧式的 "
":ref:`初始化函数 <extension-pyinit>`)。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:14
msgid ""
"To be importable by default (that is, by "
":py:class:`importlib.machinery.ExtensionFileLoader`), the shared library "
"must be available on :py:attr:`sys.path`, and must be named after the module"
" name plus an extension listed in "
":py:attr:`importlib.machinery.EXTENSION_SUFFIXES`."
msgstr ""
"要在默认情况下可被导入 (也就是说，通过 "
":py:class:`importlib.machinery.ExtensionFileLoader`)，共享库必须在 "
":py:attr:`sys.path` 中可用，并且必须命名为模块名之后加一个在 "
":py:attr:`importlib.machinery.EXTENSION_SUFFIXES` 中列出的扩展名。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:22
msgid ""
"Building, packaging and distributing extension modules is best done with "
"third-party tools, and is out of scope of this document. One suitable tool "
"is Setuptools, whose documentation can be found at "
"https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/setuptools.html."
msgstr ""
"构建、打包和分发扩展模块最好使用第三方工具完成，并且超出了本文的范围。一个合适的工具是 Setuptools，其文档可以在 "
"https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/setuptools.html 上找到。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:30
msgid "Extension export hook"
msgstr "扩展导出钩子"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:34
msgid ""
"Support for the :samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}` export hook was added in Python"
" 3.15. The older way of defining modules is still available: consult either "
"the :ref:`extension-pyinit` section or earlier versions of this "
"documentation if you plan to support earlier Python versions."
msgstr ""
"对 :samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}` 导出钩子的支持是在 Python 3.15 中增加的。 "
"定义模块的旧方式仍然可用：如果你计划支持更早的 Python 版本可以查阅 :ref:`extension-pyinit` 一节或本文档的较早版本。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:39
msgid ""
"The export hook must be an exported function with the following signature:"
msgstr "导出钩子必须是具有以下签名的导出函数："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:43
msgid ""
"For modules with ASCII-only names, the :ref:`export hook <extension-export-"
"hook>` must be named :samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}`, with ``<name>`` replaced "
"by the module's name."
msgstr ""
"对于具有仅限 ASCII 名称的模块，:ref:`导出钩子 <extension-export-hook>` 必须被命名为 "
":samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}`，其中 ``<name>`` 以模块名称替换。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:47
msgid ""
"For non-ASCII module names, the export hook must instead be named "
":samp:`PyModExportU_{<name>}` (note the ``U``), with ``<name>`` encoded "
"using Python's *punycode* encoding with hyphens replaced by underscores. In "
"Python:"
msgstr ""
"对于非 ASCII 模块名称，则导出钩子必须被命名为 :samp:`PyModExportU_{<name>}` (注意增加了 ``U``)，其中 "
"``<name>`` 使用 Python 的 *punycode* 编码格式进行编码并将连字符替换为下划线。 在 Python 中："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:51
msgid ""
"def hook_name(name):\n"
"    try:\n"
"        suffix = b'_' + name.encode('ascii')\n"
"    except UnicodeEncodeError:\n"
"        suffix = b'U_' + name.encode('punycode').replace(b'-', b'_')\n"
"    return b'PyModExport' + suffix"
msgstr ""
"def hook_name(name):\n"
"    try:\n"
"        suffix = b'_' + name.encode('ascii')\n"
"    except UnicodeEncodeError:\n"
"        suffix = b'U_' + name.encode('punycode').replace(b'-', b'_')\n"
"    return b'PyModExport' + suffix"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:60
msgid ""
"The export hook returns an array of :c:type:`PySlot` entries, terminated by "
"an entry with a slot ID of ``0``. These slots describe how the module should"
" be created and initialized."
msgstr ""
"导出钩子将返回由 :c:type:`PySlot` 条目组成的数组，以一个槽位 ID 为 ``0`` 的条目作为终结。 "
"这些槽位描述了模块应当如何被创建和初始化。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:64
msgid ""
"This array must remain valid and constant until interpreter shutdown. "
"Typically, it should use ``static`` storage. Prefer using the "
":c:macro:`Py_mod_create` and :c:macro:`Py_mod_exec` slots for any dynamic "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"这个数组必须保持可用与恒定直到解释器关闭。 通常，它应当使用 ``static`` 存储。 建议针对任何动态行为使用 "
":c:macro:`Py_mod_create` 和 :c:macro:`Py_mod_exec` 槽位。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:69
msgid ""
"The export hook may return ``NULL`` with an exception set to signal failure."
msgstr "导出钩子可以返回 ``NULL`` 并设置一个异常来发出失败信号。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:71
msgid ""
"It is recommended to define the export hook function using a helper macro:"
msgstr "建议使用一个辅助宏来定义导出钩子函数："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:75
msgid "Declare an extension module export hook. This macro:"
msgstr "声明一个扩展模块导出钩子。 这个宏："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:78
msgid "specifies the :c:expr:`PySlot*` return type,"
msgstr "指定 :c:expr:`PySlot*` 返回类型，"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:79 ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:248
msgid "adds any special linkage declarations required by the platform, and"
msgstr "添加平台所需的任何特殊链接声明，以及"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:80 ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:249
msgid "for C++, declares the function as ``extern \"C\"``."
msgstr "对于 C++，将函数声明为 ``extern \"C\"``。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:82 ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:279
msgid "For example, a module called ``spam`` would be defined like this::"
msgstr "例如，一个名为 ``spam`` 的模块可以这样定义::"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:84
msgid ""
"PyABIInfo_VAR(abi_info);\n"
"\n"
"static PySlot spam_slots[] = {\n"
"    PySlot_STATIC_DATA(Py_mod_abi, &abi_info),\n"
"    PySlot_STATIC_DATA(Py_mod_name, \"spam\"),\n"
"    PySlot_FUNC(Py_mod_exec, spam_init_function),\n"
"    ...\n"
"    PySlot_END\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"PyMODEXPORT_FUNC\n"
"PyModExport_spam(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    return spam_slots;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"PyABIInfo_VAR(abi_info);\n"
"\n"
"static PySlot spam_slots[] = {\n"
"    PySlot_STATIC_DATA(Py_mod_abi, &abi_info),\n"
"    PySlot_STATIC_DATA(Py_mod_name, \"spam\"),\n"
"    PySlot_FUNC(Py_mod_exec, spam_init_function),\n"
"    ...\n"
"    PySlot_END\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"PyMODEXPORT_FUNC\n"
"PyModExport_spam(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    return spam_slots;\n"
"}"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:100
msgid ""
"The export hook is typically the only non-\\ ``static`` item defined in the "
"module's C source."
msgstr "导出钩子通常是定义于模块 C 源代码中唯一的非 ``static`` 条目。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:105
msgid ""
"The hook should be kept short. If it does more than ``return`` a static "
"array, several caveats apply:"
msgstr "此钩子应当保持简短。 如果它在 ``return`` 一个静态数组之个还做了其他事，则需注意几点："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:108
msgid ""
"If you need to use any Python C API, it is recommended to call "
":c:func:`PyABIInfo_Check` first to raise an exception, rather than crash, in"
" common cases of ABI mismatch."
msgstr ""
"如果你需要使用任何 Python C API，在常见的 ABI 不匹配情况下，建议先调用 :c:func:`PyABIInfo_Check` "
"来引发异常，而不是让程序崩溃。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:111
msgid ""
"Code in the export hook must never rely on the :term:`GIL`: :term:`free-"
"threaded builds <free-threaded build>` of Python can only check the "
":c:macro:`Py_mod_gil` slot (or the lack of it) after the hook returns,"
msgstr ""
"导出钩子中的代码绝不可依赖于 :term:`GIL`: Python 的 :term:`自由线程构建版 <free-threaded build>` "
"只能在钩子返回后检查 :c:macro:`Py_mod_gil` 槽位（或确定其不存在）。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:114
msgid ""
"Similarly, the hook may be called in any subinterpreter, since the "
":c:macro:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` slot (or lack of it) is only checked"
" after the hook returns."
msgstr ""
"类似地，此钩子可在任意子解释器中被调用，因为对 :c:macro:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` "
"槽位的存在（或不存在）的检查只在钩子返回后才执行。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:118
msgid "For example::"
msgstr "例如::"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:120
msgid ""
"PyMODEXPORT_FUNC\n"
"PyModExport_modulename(void)\n"
"{\n"
"   if (PyABIInfo_Check(&abi_info, \"modulename\") < 0) {\n"
"      /* ABI mismatch. It's not safe to examine the raised exception. */\n"
"      return NULL;\n"
"   }\n"
"\n"
"   /* use Python API (as little as possible); don't rely on GIL */\n"
"\n"
"   return modulename_slots;\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"PyMODEXPORT_FUNC\n"
"PyModExport_modulename(void)\n"
"{\n"
"   if (PyABIInfo_Check(&abi_info, \"modulename\") < 0) {\n"
"      /* ABI mismatch. It's not safe to examine the raised exception. */\n"
"      return NULL;\n"
"   }\n"
"\n"
"   /* use Python API (as little as possible); don't rely on GIL */\n"
"\n"
"   return modulename_slots;\n"
"}"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:135
msgid ""
"It is possible to export multiple modules from a single shared library by "
"defining multiple export hooks. However, importing  them requires a custom "
"importer or suitably named copies/links of the extension file, because "
"Python's import machinery only finds the function corresponding to the "
"filename. See the `Multiple modules in one library "
"<https://peps.python.org/pep-0489/#multiple-modules-in-one-library>`__ "
"section in :pep:`489` for details."
msgstr ""
"通过定义多个导出钩子，可以从同一个共享库中导出多个模块。然而，导入这些模块需要自定义导入器，或具备合适名称的扩展文件副本/链接，因为 Python "
"的导入机制只会找到与文件名相对应的函数。详情请参阅 :pep:`489` 中的 `Multiple modules in one library "
"<https://peps.python.org/pep-0489/#multiple-modules-in-one-library>`__ 部分。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:147
msgid "Multi-phase initialization"
msgstr "多阶段初始化"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:149
msgid "The process of creating an extension module follows several phases:"
msgstr "创建扩展模块的过程包含以下几个阶段："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:151
msgid ""
"Python finds and calls the export hook to get information on how to create "
"the module."
msgstr "Python 会查找并调用导出钩子，以获取有关如何创建该模块的信息。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:153
msgid ""
"Before any substantial code is executed, Python can determine which "
"capabilities the module supports, and it can adjust the environment or "
"refuse loading an incompatible extension. Slots like :c:data:`Py_mod_abi`, "
":c:data:`Py_mod_gil` and :c:data:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` influence "
"this step."
msgstr ""
"在执行任何实质性代码之前，Python 可以确定该模块支持哪些功能，并可以调整环境或拒绝加载不兼容的扩展。诸如 "
":c:data:`Py_mod_abi`、:c:data:`Py_mod_gil` 和 "
":c:data:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` 之类的槽位会影响这一步骤。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:158
msgid ""
"By default, Python itself then creates the module object -- that is, it does"
" the equivalent of calling :py:meth:`~object.__new__` when creating an "
"object. This step can be overridden using the :c:data:`Py_mod_create` slot."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Python 随后会创建模块对象——也就是说，它在创建对象时相当于调用 :py:meth:`~object.__new__`。这一步可以通过"
" :c:data:`Py_mod_create` 槽位进行覆盖。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:161
msgid ""
"Python sets initial module attributes like :attr:`~module.__package__` and "
":attr:`~module.__loader__`, and inserts the module object into "
":py:attr:`sys.modules`."
msgstr ""
"Python 会为模块设置诸如 :attr:`~module.__package__` 和 :attr:`~module.__loader__` "
"之类的初始属性，并将模块对象插入到 :py:attr:`sys.modules` 中。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:164
msgid ""
"Afterwards, the module object is initialized in an extension-specific way --"
" the equivalent of :py:meth:`~object.__init__` when creating an object, or "
"of executing top-level code in a Python-language module. The behavior is "
"specified using the :c:data:`Py_mod_exec` slot."
msgstr ""
"随后，模块对象会以一种与扩展相关的特定方式完成初始化——这相当于创建对象时执行 :py:meth:`~object.__init__`，或相当于在 "
"Python 语言模块中执行顶层代码。其行为通过 :c:data:`Py_mod_exec` 槽位进行定义。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:169
msgid ""
"This is called *multi-phase initialization* to distinguish it from the "
"legacy (but still supported) :ref:`single-phase initialization <single-"
"phase-initialization>`, where an initialization function returns a fully "
"constructed module."
msgstr ""
"这被称为*多阶段初始化*，用以将其与传统的（但仍受支持的） :ref:`single-phase initialization <single-"
"phase-initialization>` 区分开来；在后者中，初始化函数会返回一个已完全构建好的模块。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:175
msgid "Added support for multi-phase initialization (:pep:`489`)."
msgstr "增加了对多阶段初始化的支持 (:pep:`489`)。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:179
msgid "Multiple module instances"
msgstr "多个模块实例"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:181
msgid ""
"By default, extension modules are not singletons. For example, if the "
":py:attr:`sys.modules` entry is removed and the module is re-imported, a new"
" module object is created and, typically, populated with fresh method and "
"type objects. The old module is subject to normal garbage collection. This "
"mirrors the behavior of pure-Python modules."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，扩展模块并非单例。例如，若移除 :py:attr:`sys.modules` "
"条目并重新导入该模块，则会创建一个新的模块对象；通常，该对象会被填充全新的方法和类型对象。旧模块则遵循常规的垃圾回收机制。这与纯 Python "
"模块的行为一致。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:188
msgid ""
"Additional module instances may be created in :ref:`sub-interpreters <sub-"
"interpreter-support>` or after Python runtime reinitialization "
"(:c:func:`Py_Finalize` and :c:func:`Py_Initialize`). In these cases, sharing"
" Python objects between module instances would likely cause crashes or "
"undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"额外的模块实例可能会在 :ref:`子解释器 <sub-interpreter-support>` 中或者 Python 运行时重新初始化之后 "
"(:c:func:`Py_Finalize` 和 :c:func:`Py_Initialize`) 被创建。在这些情况下，模块实例间共享 Python"
"  对象可能导致程序崩溃或未定义的行为。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:195
msgid ""
"To avoid such issues, each instance of an extension module should be "
"*isolated*: changes to one instance should not implicitly affect the others,"
" and all state owned by the module, including references to Python objects, "
"should be specific to a particular module instance. See :ref:`isolating-"
"extensions-howto` for more details and a practical guide."
msgstr ""
"为避免这种问题，每个扩展模块的实例都应当是 *隔离的*: 对一个实例的修改不应隐式地影响其他的实例，以及模块所拥有的全部状态，包括对 Python "
"对象的引用，都应当是特定模块实例专属的。请参阅 :ref:`isolating-extensions-howto` 了解更多的细节和实用的指南。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:201
msgid ""
"A simpler way to avoid these issues is :ref:`raising an error on repeated "
"initialization <isolating-extensions-optout>`."
msgstr "一个避免这些问题的简单方式是 :ref:`针对重复的初始化引发一个错误 <isolating-extensions-optout>`。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:204
msgid ""
"All modules are expected to support :ref:`sub-interpreters <sub-interpreter-"
"support>`, or otherwise explicitly signal a lack of support. This is usually"
" achieved by isolation or blocking repeated initialization, as above. A "
"module may also be limited to the main interpreter using the "
":c:data:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` slot."
msgstr ""
"所有模块都应当支持 :ref:`子解释器 <sub-interpreter-support>`，否则就要显式地发出缺乏支持的信号。 "
"这往往是通过隔离或阻止重复的初始化，如上文所述。一个模块也可以使用 :c:data:`Py_mod_multiple_interpreters` "
"槽位将其限制于主解释器中。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:216
msgid "``PyInit`` function"
msgstr "``PyInit`` 函数"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:220
msgid ""
"This functionality will not get new features, but there are no plans to "
"remove it."
msgstr "该功能不会获得新功能，但目前暂无将其移除的计划。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:223
msgid ""
"Instead of :c:func:`PyModExport_modulename`, an extension module can define "
"an older-style :dfn:`initialization function` with the signature:"
msgstr ""
"与 :c:func:`PyModExport_modulename` 不同，扩展模块可以定义一种采用旧式签名的 :dfn:`initialization"
" function`，其签名如下："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:228
msgid ""
"Its name should be :samp:`PyInit_{<name>}`, with ``<name>`` replaced by the "
"name of the module. For non-ASCII module names, use :samp:`PyInitU_{<name>}`"
" instead, with ``<name>`` encoded in the same way as for the :ref:`export "
"hook <extension-export-hook>` (that is, using Punycode with underscores)."
msgstr ""
"其名称应为 :samp:`PyInit_{<name>}`，其中 ``<name>`` 应替换为模块名称。对于非 ASCII 模块名称，则应使用 "
":samp:`PyInitU_{<name>}`；此时 ``<name>`` 的编码方式应与 :ref:`export hook <extension-"
"export-hook>` 相同（即使用带下划线的 Punycode）。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:235
msgid ""
"If a module exports both :samp:`PyInit_{<name>}` and "
":samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}`, the :samp:`PyInit_{<name>}` function is "
"ignored."
msgstr ""
"如果某个模块同时导出 :samp:`PyInit_{<name>}` 和 :samp:`PyModExport_{<name>}`，则 "
":samp:`PyInit_{<name>}` 函数将被忽略。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:239
msgid ""
"Like with :c:macro:`PyMODEXPORT_FUNC`, it is recommended to define the "
"initialization function using a helper macro:"
msgstr "与 :c:macro:`PyMODEXPORT_FUNC` 类似，建议使用辅助宏来定义初始化函数："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:244
msgid "Declare an extension module initialization function. This macro:"
msgstr "声明一个扩展模块初始化函数。这个宏："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:247
msgid "specifies the :c:expr:`PyObject*` return type,"
msgstr "指定了 :c:expr:`PyObject*` 返回类型，"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:252
msgid ""
"Normally, the initialization function (``PyInit_modulename``) returns a "
":c:type:`PyModuleDef` instance with non-``NULL`` "
":c:member:`~PyModuleDef.m_slots`. This allows Python to use :ref:`multi-"
"phase initialization <multi-phase-initialization>`."
msgstr ""
"通常，初始化函数 (``PyInit_modulename``) 会返回一个包含非 ``NULL`` "
":c:member:`~PyModuleDef.m_slots` 的 :c:type:`PyModuleDef` 实例。这使得 Python 能够使用 "
":ref:`multi-phase initialization <multi-phase-initialization>`。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:257
msgid ""
"Before it is returned, the ``PyModuleDef`` instance must be initialized "
"using the following function:"
msgstr "在将其返回之前，必须使用以下函数对 ``PyModuleDef`` 实例进行初始化："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:262
msgid ""
"Ensure a module definition is a properly initialized Python object that "
"correctly reports its type and a reference count."
msgstr "确保模块定义是一个正确初始化的 Python 对象，并正确报告其类型以及引用计数。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:265
msgid "Return *def* cast to ``PyObject*``, or ``NULL`` if an error occurred."
msgstr "返回强制转换为 ``PyObject*`` 的 *def*，或者如果出现错误则返回 ``NULL``。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:267
msgid ""
"Calling this function is required before returning a :c:type:`PyModuleDef` "
"from a module initialization function. It should not be used in other "
"contexts."
msgstr "在模块初始化函数中返回 :c:type:`PyModuleDef` 之前，必须调用此函数。不应在其他上下文中使用此函数。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:271
msgid ""
"Note that Python assumes that ``PyModuleDef`` structures are statically "
"allocated. This function may return either a new reference or a borrowed "
"one; this reference must not be released."
msgstr "请注意 Python 会假定 ``PyModuleDef`` 结构体是静态分配的。此函数可以返回一个新引用或借用引用；这个引用不可被释放。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:281
msgid ""
"static struct PyModuleDef spam_module = {\n"
"    .m_base = PyModuleDef_HEAD_INIT,\n"
"    .m_name = \"spam\",\n"
"    ...\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"PyMODINIT_FUNC\n"
"PyInit_spam(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    return PyModuleDef_Init(&spam_module);\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"static struct PyModuleDef spam_module = {\n"
"    .m_base = PyModuleDef_HEAD_INIT,\n"
"    .m_name = \"spam\",\n"
"    ...\n"
"};\n"
"\n"
"PyMODINIT_FUNC\n"
"PyInit_spam(void)\n"
"{\n"
"    return PyModuleDef_Init(&spam_module);\n"
"}"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:297
msgid "Legacy single-phase initialization"
msgstr "旧式的单阶段初始化"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:301
msgid ""
"Single-phase initialization is a legacy mechanism to initialize extension "
"modules, with known drawbacks and design flaws. Extension module authors are"
" encouraged to use multi-phase initialization instead."
msgstr "单阶段初始化是一种用于初始化扩展模块的旧机制，它具有已知的缺点和设计瑕疵。建议扩展模块作者改用多阶段初始化。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:305
msgid "However, there are no plans to remove support for it."
msgstr "不过，目前暂无计划取消对其的支持。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:307
msgid ""
"In single-phase initialization, the old-style :ref:`initialization function "
"<extension-pyinit>` (``PyInit_modulename``) should create, populate and "
"return a module object. This is typically done using "
":c:func:`PyModule_Create` and functions like "
":c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef`."
msgstr ""
"在单阶段初始化过程中，旧式 :ref:`initialization function <extension-pyinit>` "
"(``PyInit_modulename``) 应创建、填充并返回一个模块对象。通常通过 :c:func:`PyModule_Create` 以及 "
":c:func:`PyModule_AddObjectRef` 等函数来实现这一操作。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:313
msgid ""
"Single-phase initialization differs from the :ref:`default <multi-phase-"
"initialization>` in the following ways:"
msgstr "单阶段初始化与 :ref:`默认方式 <multi-phase-initialization>` 的主要区别如下："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:316
msgid ""
"Single-phase modules with :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_size` set to -1 are, or "
"rather *contain*, “singletons”."
msgstr "将 :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_size` 设置为 -1 的单相模块，或者更准确地说，是“包含”“单例”的模块。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:319
msgid ""
"When such a module is first initialized, Python saves the contents of the "
"module's ``__dict__`` (that is, typically, the module's functions and "
"types)."
msgstr "当此类模块首次完成初始化时，Python 会保存该模块的 ``__dict__`` 内容（通常即该模块中的函数和类型）。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:323
msgid ""
"For subsequent imports, Python does not call the initialization function "
"again. Instead, it creates a new module object with a new ``__dict__``, and "
"copies the saved contents to it. Modules are matched to the saved contents "
"by a (*module_name*, *file_name*) tuple where:"
msgstr ""
"对于后续的导入操作，Python 不会再次调用初始化函数；相反，它会创建一个带有新 ``__dict__`` "
"的新模块对象，并将已保存的内容复制到其中。模块通过 (*module_name*，*file_name*) 元组与已保存的内容进行匹配，其中："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:330
msgid ""
"*module_name* is the module's full dotted name, taken from "
":py:attr:`ModuleSpec.name <importlib.machinery.ModuleSpec.name>` (or the "
"equivalent argument of the importing function). Note that names that the "
"initialization function uses to create the module (for example, "
":c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_name`) are not taken into account."
msgstr ""
"*module_name* 是该模块的完整点分隔名称，取自 :py:attr:`ModuleSpec.name "
"<importlib.machinery.ModuleSpec.name>` （或导入函数中对应的参数）。请注意，初始化函数用于创建模块的名称（例如 "
":c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_name`）不会被纳入考虑。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:335
msgid ""
"*file_name* is the extension's file name. It is unset for modules not loaded"
" from a file, such as built-ins and modules added with "
":c:func:`PyImport_CreateModuleFromInitfunc` or "
":c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab`."
msgstr ""
"*file_name* 是扩展名对应的文件名。对于未从文件中加载的模块（例如内置模块，以及通过 "
":c:func:`PyImport_CreateModuleFromInitfunc` 或 "
":c:func:`PyImport_AppendInittab` 添加的模块），该变量未设置。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:340
msgid ""
"As part of the first initialization, Python also adds the module to "
":data:`sys.modules` under its name. For example, given a single-phase module"
" ``_testsinglephase`` [#testsinglephase]_ that defines a function ``sum`` "
"and an exception class ``error``:"
msgstr ""
"作为首次初始化的一部分，Python 还会以该模块的名称将其添加到 :data:`sys.modules` 中。例如，假设有一个单相位模块 "
"``_testsinglephase`` [#testsinglephase]_，该模块定义了一个函数 ``sum`` 和一个异常类 "
"``error``："

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:346
msgid ""
">>> import sys\n"
">>> import _testsinglephase as one\n"
">>> del sys.modules['_testsinglephase']\n"
">>> import _testsinglephase as two\n"
">>> one is two\n"
"False\n"
">>> one.__dict__ is two.__dict__\n"
"False\n"
">>> one.sum is two.sum\n"
"True\n"
">>> one.error is two.error\n"
"True"
msgstr ""
">>> import sys\n"
">>> import _testsinglephase as one\n"
">>> del sys.modules['_testsinglephase']\n"
">>> import _testsinglephase as two\n"
">>> one is two\n"
"False\n"
">>> one.__dict__ is two.__dict__\n"
"False\n"
">>> one.sum is two.sum\n"
"True\n"
">>> one.error is two.error\n"
"True"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:361
msgid ""
"The exact behavior should be considered a CPython implementation detail."
msgstr "该具体行为应被视为 CPython 的实现细节。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:363
msgid ""
"For single-phase modules with non-negative :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_size`, "
"Python may cache a pointer to the initialization function under the "
"(*module_name*, *file_name*) key as for ``m_size == -1``."
msgstr ""
"对于具有非负 :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_size` 的单相模块，Python 可能会像对待 ``m_size == -1`` "
"那样，在 (*module_name*，*file_name*) 键下缓存一个指向初始化函数的指针。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:367
msgid ""
"Subsequent imports that specify a different initialization function (for "
"example, using :c:func:`PyImport_CreateModuleFromInitfunc`) may call either "
"the cached function or the provided \"new\" one."
msgstr ""
"后续指定不同初始化函数的导入（例如使用 "
":c:func:`PyImport_CreateModuleFromInitfunc`）可能会调用缓存函数，也可能调用所提供的“新”函数。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:371
msgid ""
"The exact behavior should again be considered a CPython implementation "
"detail."
msgstr "具体行为应再次被视为 CPython 的实现细节。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:373
msgid ""
"To work around the fact that ``PyInit_modulename`` does not take a *spec* "
"argument, some state of the import machinery is saved and applied to the "
"first suitable module created during the ``PyInit_modulename`` call. "
"Specifically, when a sub-module is imported, this mechanism prepends the "
"parent package name to the name of the module."
msgstr ""
"为解决 ``PyInit_modulename`` 函数不接受 *spec* 参数的限制，导入机制会保存部分状态，并在 "
"``PyInit_modulename`` 调用期间将其应用于首个匹配的模块对象。具体表现为：当导入子模块时，该机制会将父包名称自动前置到模块名前。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:379
msgid ""
"A single-phase ``PyInit_modulename`` function should create “its” module "
"object as soon as possible, before any other module objects can be created."
msgstr "单阶段 ``PyInit_modulename`` 函数应当尽早创建\"其所属\"模块对象，该操作需在任何其他模块对象创建之前完成。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:382
msgid "Non-ASCII module names (``PyInitU_modulename``) are not supported."
msgstr "不支持非 ASCII 模块名 (``PyInitU_modulename``)。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:384
msgid ""
"Single-phase modules support module lookup functions like "
":c:func:`PyState_FindModule`."
msgstr "单阶段模块支持模块查找函数如 :c:func:`PyState_FindModule`。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:387
msgid "The module's :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_slots` must be NULL."
msgstr "该模块的 :c:member:`PyModuleDef.m_slots` 必须为 NULL。"

#: ../../c-api/extension-modules.rst:389
msgid ""
"``_testsinglephase`` is an internal module used in CPython's self-test "
"suite; your installation may or may not include it."
msgstr "``_testsinglephase`` 是一个在 CPython 的自我测试套件中使用的内部模块；你的安装版可能包括它也可能不包括它。"
